WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:02.740
(gentle music)

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:04.010
- [Narrator] Do you
ever feel like sometimes

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.800
nothing seems to be going
right and then your one friend

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:09.020
who is super into astrology explains

00:00:09.020 --> 00:00:10.853
that mercury is in retrograde?

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.630
The first thing we need to clear up,

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.460
is that mercury is not in retrograde,

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.720
mercury is just retrograde.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:19.790
This is the astronomical phenomenon

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:22.320
when a planet appears
to be moving backwards

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.423
reversing its orbit from our
point of view here on earth.

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.543
It's actually an optical illusion.

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:30.510
You see, planets orbit the
sun at different speeds

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:32.390
and retrograde occurs generally

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:34.670
as a faster moving planet catches up with

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:36.923
and then passes a slower moving planet.

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.130
Other planets retrograde
too but because mercury

00:00:40.130 --> 00:00:42.270
is the fastest planet in the solar system,

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.970
it retrogrades more frequently

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.780
about three to four times a year

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.883
and lasts for about two to three weeks.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.010
Ancient Romans and Greeks personified

00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.523
the planet mercury as the messenger deity.

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:56.433
Similarly in astrology, mercury
rules over communication.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:58.440
It also governs analytical thinking,

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:01.633
expression of ideas, and the
processing of information.

00:01:02.070 --> 00:01:04.950
So, in astrology when mercury retrogrades,

00:01:04.950 --> 00:01:07.353
all those things get kind of scrambled.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.080
Hence why some people feel utter

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:11.140
and total chaos during this period.

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:13.070
Different mercury retrogrades can have

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:14.580
different effects on us depending

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.320
on which sign it's moving through

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:19.330
and they can take on more of
the qualities of that sign.

00:01:19.330 --> 00:01:22.320
For instance, the sign Cancer
is associated with home

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:25.063
and family as well as emotional intensity.

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:27.150
A mercury retrograding through Cancer

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:29.330
could have us focus on
aspects of our family

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:31.010
and home life and get deeper in touch

00:01:31.010 --> 00:01:32.293
with our emotional state.

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:35.260
In 2018, all mercury retrogrades

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:39.293
will pass through fire signs,
Aries, Leo, and Sagittarius.

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:40.950
Therefore, we may be more willing

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:43.010
than normal to engage
in conflict over things

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:46.373
we're passionate about because
that's what fire signs do.

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.130
While there is generally
a negative connotation

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:51.003
surrounding retrograde periods,

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:53.500
there are also ways to
interpret mercury retrograde

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:54.703
that are more positive.

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:57.763
Since things will feel a
little crazy during retrograde,

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:00.910
it can be a good opportunity
to do some internal reflecting

00:02:00.910 --> 00:02:03.063
rather than making impulsive decisions.

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:05.120
This can give you a chance to reassess

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.733
your desires and purpose.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.880
So, now you know everything you need

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:11.023
to know about mercury retrograde.

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:14.463
Have fun using it as an excuse
for all of your problems.

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:18.087
Damn you mercury, damn you!

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:24.743
(gentle music)

